WEBVTT

00:10:29.416 --> 00:10:31.502
This type of comment, I'll just show you.

00:10:32.753 --> 00:10:35.005
“Look up Bo Burnham, if you liked.”

00:10:35.047 --> 00:10:38.175
And then the person said,
"I did look him up and he's really good.

00:10:38.175 --> 00:10:39.760
Thanks for the suggestion."

00:10:39.802 --> 00:10:41.470
Guys, can we focus on me?

00:10:41.512 --> 00:10:42.638
(Laughter)

00:10:42.638 --> 00:10:44.390
Can we please focus on me?

00:10:44.765 --> 00:10:47.476
Bo Burnham has had three
Netflix specials, alright?

00:10:47.518 --> 00:10:50.229
I just quit my job
at customer support, OK?

00:10:50.229 --> 00:10:52.606
So let's just focus on me.

00:10:52.648 --> 00:10:53.899
OK, it's my song.

00:10:53.941 --> 00:10:55.484
OK, thank you.

00:10:55.526 --> 00:10:58.278
(Laughter)

00:10:58.320 --> 00:10:59.947
Thank you so much.

00:10:59.947 --> 00:11:01.615
This last one.